{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41836","headline":"赠永真杜作翺少府 · 李中","name":"赠永真杜作翺少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓝袍竹简佐琴堂，县僻人稀觉日长。\n爱静不嫌官况冷，苦吟从听鬓毛苍。\n闲寻野寺听秋水，寄睡僧窗到夕阳。\n骞翥会应霄汉去，渔竿休更恋沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}